 "text": "Action Plan\nAGENCY ACTION PLAN\nPerson/Dept.\nResponsible\nStatus of\nTarget Implementation Date\nFrom\nTo\nOffice of the City\nMayor\nImplementation\nOngoing\nReason for Partial/Delay/\nNon-Implementation, If\napplicable\nAction Taken/Action to\nbe Taken\nReference\nAudit Observations\nCY 2018 AAR,\n10. The creation, organization and operation of\nObservation No. 15, an Internal Audit Service (IAS) mandated under\nPage 91\nSection 2 of RA No. 3456 as amended by RA No.\n4177 was not undertaken by the City, thus,\nManagement was not accorded with the\nassistance in the achievement of an efficient and\neffective fiscal administration and performance\nof agency affairs and functions.\nCY 2018 AAR,\n11. The excess amount of collections/proceeds\nObservation No. 16, from sale of bld documents and other related\nPage 92\nfees amounting to P13.958 million as of\nDecember 31, 2018 was still being maintained\nunder the TF Instead of transferring the same to\nthe GF pursuant to Item 6.2 of DBM Circular No.\n2004-5A.\nAudit Recommendations\nWe recommended that the LCE facilitate the\ncreatlon, organization and operation of the\nCity's IAS as required under RA No. 3456 as\namended by RA No. 4177, to assist in the\nachievement of an efficient and effective\nfiscal administration and performance of\nCity's affairs and functions.\nWe recommended that Management direct\nthe City Treasurer to cause the Immedlate\ntransfer of the unutilized amount of the\nproceeds from the collection of bid\ndocuments and related fees from the TF to\nthe GF\nOCAT\nAgency sign-off:\nJonathan R. Galorio\nOE Office of the City Accountant\nName and Position of Agency Officer\nNote: Status of implementation may elther be (a) Fully Implemented, (b) Ongoing, (c) Not Implemented, (d) Partially Implemented, or (e) Delayed\n31-Jul-24\nDate\n2024\n2024\nFully\nImplemented\nThe OCAT already\ndetermined the correct\namount of\ncollection/proceed form\nsale of bld documents\nand other related fees\nto be transferred to the\nGF amounting to\nPhp6,923,146.93. The\nsald amount is already\ntransferred to the GF\nthru JEV No. 300-24-04-\n06 dated 15 June 2024\n",
